(1844, 2, 1792590135, 'aiprovider_azureai', 'action_generate_text_systeminstruction', 'You will receive a text input from the user. Your task is to generate text based on their request. Follow these important instructions:\n    1. Return the summary in plain text only.\n    2. Do not include any markdown formatting, greetings, or platitudes.', NULL),
